    "long_instructions": "## Test and Trust\r\nGoal: Test your model for real users. Write when people should and should not trust it.\r\n\r\nMove your Data Scientist to each stop as you start it.\r\n- **Try Stop 1:** Drag your two users into the User column. Copy each user's categories and prediction from **Test for My User** in your guide. Drag a ✓ or ✗ into Right?\r\n- **Try Stop 2:** Add each user's tree from your **Backpack**. Drag each user to the leaf where their path ends. Finish \"It went wrong at …\"\r\n- **Try Stop 3:** Answer the Name and Zoom Out questions.\r\n- **Try Stop 4:** Write your draft model card.\r\n\r\nYou are done when Try Stops 1–4 have an answer.",
